{"surah":104,"ayahs":["وَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">لٌ لِّ</span>كُلِّ هُمَزَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةٍ لُّ</span>مَزَةٍ","ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَال<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">اً وَ</span>عَدَّدَهُۥ","يَحْسَبُ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> مَالَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أَخْلَدَهُۥ","كَلَّا‌ۖ لَيُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">نۢبَ</span>ذَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحُطَمَةِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحُطَمَةُ","نَارُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُوقَدَةُ","ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَفْــِٔدَةِ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هَا عَلَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">هِم مُّ</span>ؤْصَدَةٌ","فِى عَمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ مُّ</span>مَدَّدَةِۭ"]}